From b9fc37636e44bcb99c8271582654425fe757aea7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:31:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bugfix: preserve renamed Cargo dependencies in Bazel targets

Generate dependency-kind and platform-aware aliases through the rules_rs public API so renamed keyring and YAML crates compile correctly. Keep the public skill-frontmatter regression and add configured checks for normal, development, build and unconditional aliases.

The emitted six-file generator repair passed all 18 configured checks and all nine secrets library tests with test-result caching disabled. This replacement packages that implementation with the existing YAML regression at its actual queue position; fresh sorted-queue replay and maintained checks remain required.
